    "implementation_delta": "Add InterfaceParitySurface@1 and InterfaceParityQualification@1. Bind live local POSIX put/get/digest/delete to the canonical operation registry and project them through Python, CLI, MCP, and MCP++ adapters under AllInterfaceParityPolicy@1. Semantic payloads and CIDs matched after transport-only field strip. MCP tools package import no longer requires anyio. Live MCP stdio/HTTP/P2P server processes were not started and stay typed unavailable. Sealed PATH has no ipfs executable; live IPFS stays typed unavailable. Adapter sessions cannot mint a closed PCPR release. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state."
  },
